# Language Test 202505 - FutureContest2019FinalA: Monster Tamer
# Baseline valid heuristic: ignore jobs and work part-time for all T turns.
Sonome kas T kasta N kasta M tas Kisite kas readints vis 3.
Sonome kas row tas [].
Pilike kas i pas Kisite kas pilika vis M {
    Kemese kas row tas Kisite kas readints vis N + 3.
}
Pilike kas turn pas Kisite kas pilika vis T {
    Takute kas 3.
}
